{
  "about": "Synthetic CV blocks for the Cofferdam Work pipeline (cofferdam-api test/fixtures/work). Every person, employer, school and place is invented, and identifying strings are already replaced by the phone's placeholders ([ORG_1], [PLACE_1]); no real personal data. Each block is what the phone's cloud executor sends: one block per request, never the header, contact, references or personal blocks (decision 0021). `expected` holds the gold fields for the extraction evaluation; dates are parsed values (YYYY or YYYY-MM) and every other string is an exact span of the block. `listing` is the coarse projection the worker would publish (region and scope only).",
